 "purpose": "Herhalen › Gemengd oefenen: questions from several themes mixed in one series so the child forgets nothing.",
 "details": "The plan (which questions, which themes) comes from kern/reeks.py; the themes are the domains of the curriculum (curriculum.gemengd_themas). The Gemengd class lets the child tick themes (afvinklijst) or, if the parent fixed them, shows them and starts. Then it builds a Reeksplan with reeks.gemengd_plan and plays it with Oefenaar.speel_plan; after a finished series a one-time parent choice expires (reeks.na_reeks) and the new settings are stored. The child can play 'another series' with the same themes without choosing again.",
 "module_docstring": "Herhalen › Gemengd oefenen: vragen uit verschillende thema's door elkaar, zodat het kind niets vergeet.",
